cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7cwrNgfo7I0Q7kNvwFcCT6U&_nc_oc=Adk4qByb5Md_pJKeWzKUMw_fe2--42Ipo6YM17V3OWcy_y9V3GnxY06y3ica6HHaHHk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxhzSpWD9uWHs_ipFwLZ1Sssi1Y8KPWtdj7Vc97_GATGw&oe=69B2B2CC"}, {"file_name": "Bingo16-9.png", "id": "1434116907874356", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820574_1434116911207689_8961654679034847196_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RPbaHlMBVXkQ7kNvwF3nASg&_nc_oc=AdmEK__Sqa8pcoO32-kyMnchgSn6rIJqJT6urt65epJeweGy5nC8r8T3tS7DkvEd_VY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw3gEStYormJsHq6rwGnVA9gHFVYC7nV4vZN-NHapkgnA&oe=69B2BE43"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Jackpot VR: Vegas Slots", "keywords": ["casino", "slots", "vegas", "social"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfb0 Step Into the Future of Jackpots!\n\nWelcome to Jackpot VR - the ultimate virtual-reality casino where every spin feels real, every win feels epic, and the thrill never ends.\n\n\ud83d\udc8e Key Features:\n\n\ud83c\udfa1 Immersive VR Slots: Feel the reels spin, lights flash, and jackpots explode all around you!\n\n\ud83d\udcb0 Massive Wins & Daily Rewards: Log in daily for free coins, bonus spins, and mega jackpots.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Level Up & Unlock More: The higher you climb, the bigger the prizes - unlock premium slot worlds and special events.\n\n\ud83c\udf87 Epic Themes, Endless Thrills: From fiery phoenixes to cosmic reels, every machine is a new adventure.\n\nSoar into the spotlight, chase your dream jackpot, and make every spin count.\n\u2728 Jackpot VR - Spin. Win. Live the thrill. \u2728", "short_description": "Step inside the ultimate virtual casino where the excitement of Las Vegas comes alive in stunning virtual reality. Jackpot VR transforms classic slot play into a fully immersive experience\u2014spin, win, and celebrate in a vibrant 360\u00b0 casino environment."}]}, "developer_name": n